'''Growing Purple''' (進化の紫マタタビ, ''Shinka no Murasaki Matabi'', '''Evolution Purple Actinidia''') is the [[Catfruit]] gathering daily event of Tuesday. By clearing any of these stages, you might get a Purple Catfruit, a Purple Seed or an Epic Catfruit. You also have a small chance to unlock and play the special stage Catfruit Jubilee. This event was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

